{{define "body"}}
Hi,

Your alias {{.alias}} has been deactivated because a one-click unsubscribe request was received.

All emails sent to this alias are now discarded, not just emails from the sender you unsubscribed from.

Request details:
{{- if .timestamp}}
When: {{.timestamp}}
{{- end}}
{{- if .ip}}
IP address: {{.ip}}
{{- end}}
{{- if .userAgent}}
User agent: {{.userAgent}}
{{- end}}

If you didn't intend to do this, you can reactivate the alias from your aliases:
{{.origin}}/account

Sent by {{.from}}
{{end}}

{{define "bodyHtml"}}
<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;">
Hi,<br><br>
Your alias <strong>{{.alias}}</strong> has been deactivated because a one-click unsubscribe request was received.<br><br>
<strong>All emails sent to this alias are now discarded</strong>, not just emails from the sender you unsubscribed from.<br><br>
Request details:<br>
{{- if .timestamp}}
When: {{.timestamp}}<br>
{{- end}}
{{- if .ip}}
IP address: {{.ip}}<br>
{{- end}}
{{- if .userAgent}}
User agent: {{.userAgent}}<br>
{{- end}}
<br>
If you didn't intend to do this, you can reactivate the alias from your aliases.<br><br>
<a href="{{.origin}}/account" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 16px;background:#1a1a1a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;">View Your Aliases</a><br><br>
Sent by {{.from}}
</div>
{{end}}
